@api = http://localhost:5080/api

### Branches (the warehouse is a branch with isWarehouse = true)
GET {{api}}/branches

### Products
GET {{api}}/products

### Stock at Colombo (id 2)
GET {{api}}/branches/2/stock

### Create a transfer Colombo → Kandy. Re-sending with the same Idempotency-Key returns the same transfer.
POST {{api}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c7c2e-4a8b-4f8e-9b0c-1a2b3c4d5e6f

{
  "fromBranchId": 2,
  "toBranchId": 3,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 5 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}

### Invalid: same branch, zero quantity (400 with field errors)
POST {{api}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromBranchId": 2, "toBranchId": 2, "lines": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 0 } ] }

### List transfers involving Kandy that are still Requested
GET {{api}}/transfers?branchId=3&status=Requested

### Get one transfer
GET {{api}}/transfers/1

### Dispatch (stock leaves the sender). Sending it twice moves stock once.
POST {{api}}/transfers/1/dispatch

### Receive (stock arrives at the receiver)
POST {{api}}/transfers/1/receive

### Cancel (only while Requested)
POST {{api}}/transfers/1/cancel
